OVERVIEW: Launch an installed app

USAGE: xtool launch [--udid <udid>] [--usb] [--network] [--all] <bundle-id> [<arg> ...]

ARGUMENTS:
  <bundle-id>             The app to launch
  <arg>                   Launch arguments to pass to the app

OPTIONS:
  -u, --udid <udid>
  --usb/--network/--all   (default: --all)
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

